{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"NUM","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"民數記","commonName":"民數記","title":"民數記","order":4,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"85178673aa1b8f4f59166e042dd1f8eca3a7c3393527850eb9a97150672c5b13","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1267},"chapter":{"number":30,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["許願的條例"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["摩西對以色列各支派的首領說：「以下是耶和華的吩咐。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「人若在什麼事上向耶和華許願或起誓，就不可食言，必須履行諾言。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["倘若未出嫁的少女在什麼事上向耶和華許願或起誓，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["她父親得知她許的願或起的誓後沒有反對，她許的願和起的誓就都有效；"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["倘若她父親得知後加以反對，她許的願和起的誓就無效。耶和華必不追究她，因為她父親反對。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["「倘若有女子出嫁前許了願或信口起了誓，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["她丈夫得知後沒有反對，她許的願和起的誓就都有效；"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["倘若她丈夫得知後加以反對，她許的願和起的誓就無效，耶和華必不追究她。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["寡婦或被休的婦人若在什麼事上許願或起誓，就必須履行誓言。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["「倘若已婚婦女在夫家許願或起誓，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["她丈夫得知後沒有反對，她許的願和起的誓就都有效；"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["倘若她丈夫在得知當天加以否定，她口中許的願和起的誓就無效。她丈夫已經使之無效，耶和華必不追究她。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["丈夫有權贊同或否定妻子禁食所許的願或起的誓。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["倘若丈夫得知妻子許願或起誓當天一直沒有反對，她就必須履行誓言，因為丈夫當天默認了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["倘若丈夫當天默認了，後來又加以反對，他就要承擔妻子的罪責。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["以上是耶和華藉摩西頒佈的有關丈夫和妻子、父親和未出嫁的女兒要遵守的條例。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/30.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/31.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/29.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}